# temple-run-2 1.137.0 (Google Play split APK, Unity il2cpp, arm64 only -> native bridge). Positions read at 562x900 content.
# Fresh root: "Downloading Config..." splash -> loading -> intro -> "New This Season!" news (OK) -> "Daily Reward" (Close) -> "Starter Bundle" offer (Close; Buy sits at 375 735, never touched) -> menu -> PLAY -> "Swipe To Jump" tutorial.
size 562 900
needs arm64
control break-input
unreachable news, reward and offer content: served from the network config, changes with the season
unreachable starter bundle bought: costs money
unreachable save-me ad: AppLovin content from the network
unreachable score: drawn digits only, no log line
unreachable jump registered: no log line marks a swipe, and the running picture changes with or without one
# the store and the ad SDK start with the menu UI
wait-log app "Screen DPI Percent" 180000
# the news dialog's colours are parsed just before it opens (S4 probe tr2-p2: dialog up ~2 s after); its OK button row then holds still
wait-log app "Invalid hex color string" 120000
wait-stable 180 760 200 120 120000 2000
mark news 80 60 400 700
touch 281 820 150
# each next dialog slides in over the animated menu: a touch during the slide was ignored (gate s4-gate3), so each waits for its whole dialog to hold still
wait-stable 80 60 400 700 20000 2000
expect-changed news 80 60 400 700
mark reward 80 60 400 700
touch 281 820 150
wait-stable 40 300 480 500 20000 2000
expect-changed reward 80 60 400 700
mark bundle 40 300 480 500
touch 185 735 150
wait-stable 180 790 200 90 10000 1000
expect-changed bundle 40 300 480 500
mark menu
touch 281 835 150
wait-changed 0 0 562 900 10000
wait 2500
expect-changed menu
# floor = half the lowest of 3 means over this window, WSL x86_64 readback, job s4-tr2-b2: 56.3 / 34.4 / 41.1
expect-fps 17.2 tier=readback over 4000
mark run
touch-swipe 281 600 281 300 150
wait-changed 0 0 562 900 3000
expect-audio 5000
expect-no-log services "refused IActivityTaskManager"
